WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Juri’s Drive Impact reaches Ryu at the wall.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.550
Forward heavy connects after the wall crush.

3
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.550
OD Go Ohsatsu launches Ryu from the forward-heavy hit.

4
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.050
A fresh OD Ankensatsu command continues the juggle.

5
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.050
The additional medium-kick OD follow-up extends the juggle and spends one Fuha.

6
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.050
Sakkai Fuhazan starts after the OD chain.

7
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.550
The Level 1 juggle ends in a corner knockdown.
